{"seq":1,"slug":"pr-automation-agents","title":"PR 自动化 Agent","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-native-cicd/agent-workflows/pr-automation-agents","wordCount":1106,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"pr-自动化-agent\">PR 自动化 Agent</h1><p>PR 生命周期管理是工程团队中最高频的重复性工作之一。从 PR 提交到合并，涉及描述完善、标签打标、审查者分配、测试状态跟踪、合并冲突处理、发布说明生成等一系列决策。这些工作单独来看都不复杂，但累积起来占据了大量工程师的碎片时间。</p>\n<p>PR 自动化 Agent 的目标是将这些可预测的决策环节自动化，让工程师的注意力集中在代码质量本身，而非 PR 流程管理。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>PR 描述生成</strong>（PR Description Generation）指 agent 基于代码 diff 和提交历史，自动生成结构化的 PR 描述（包括变更目的、影响范围、测试计划），替代工程师手写模板。</p>\n<p><strong>智能审查者分配</strong>（Smart Reviewer Assignment）指 agent 基于文件变更历史（谁最近修改了这些文件）、代码所有权（CODEOWNERS 文件）和当前团队负载，推荐最合适的审查者，而非随机轮转。</p>\n<p><strong>PR 健康监控</strong>（PR Health Monitoring）指持续追踪 PR 的 review 进度、阻塞原因、平均 cycle time，在 PR 超期（超过 SLA）时主动触发提醒或升级。</p>\n<h2 id=\"pr-生命周期自动化全景\">PR 生命周期自动化全景</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    OPEN[PR 开启] --&gt; DESC[生成/完善 PR 描述]&#10;    DESC --&gt; ASSIGN[智能分配审查者]&#10;    ASSIGN --&gt; LABEL[自动打标签\\n规模/类型/影响范围]&#10;&#10;    LABEL --&gt; REVIEW_WAIT[等待 Review]&#10;    REVIEW_WAIT --&gt;|超过 SLA| REMIND[发送提醒\\n通知 PR 作者和审查者]&#10;&#10;    REVIEW_WAIT --&gt; APPROVED[审查通过]&#10;    APPROVED --&gt; CONFLICT{检测合并冲突}&#10;    CONFLICT --&gt;|有冲突| RESOLVE[AI 辅助冲突解析建议]&#10;    CONFLICT --&gt;|无冲突| MERGE_READY[可以合并]&#10;    RESOLVE --&gt; MERGE_READY&#10;&#10;    MERGE_READY --&gt; MERGE[合并]&#10;    MERGE --&gt; CHANGELOG[更新变更日志]&#10;    MERGE --&gt; NOTIFY[通知相关方]\">flowchart TD\n    OPEN[PR 开启] --&gt; DESC[生成/完善 PR 描述]\n    DESC --&gt; ASSIGN[智能分配审查者]\n    ASSIGN --&gt; LABEL[自动打标签\\n规模/类型/影响范围]\n\n    LABEL --&gt; REVIEW_WAIT[等待 Review]\n    REVIEW_WAIT --&gt;|超过 SLA| REMIND[发送提醒\\n通知 PR 作者和审查者]\n\n    REVIEW_WAIT --&gt; APPROVED[审查通过]\n    APPROVED --&gt; CONFLICT{检测合并冲突}\n    CONFLICT --&gt;|有冲突| RESOLVE[AI 辅助冲突解析建议]\n    CONFLICT --&gt;|无冲突| MERGE_READY[可以合并]\n    RESOLVE --&gt; MERGE_READY\n\n    MERGE_READY --&gt; MERGE[合并]\n    MERGE --&gt; CHANGELOG[更新变更日志]\n    MERGE --&gt; NOTIFY[通知相关方]</pre><h2 id=\"pr-描述自动生成\">PR 描述自动生成</h2><p>完整且结构化的 PR 描述是高效 code review 的前提。Agent 基于 diff 和提交历史生成标准化描述：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// scripts/pr-description-gen.mjs&#10;async function generatePRDescription(diff, commits, linkedIssues) {&#10;  const prompt = `Generate a clear, structured PR description based on the following:&#10;&#10;Code diff (first 3000 chars):&#10;${diff.slice(0, 3000)}&#10;&#10;Commit messages:&#10;${commits.map((c) =&gt; `- ${c.message}`).join(&#39;\\n&#39;)}&#10;&#10;${linkedIssues.length &gt; 0 ? `Linked issues: ${linkedIssues.join(&#39;, &#39;)}` : &#39;&#39;}&#10;&#10;Output a markdown PR description with these sections:&#10;## What&#10;Brief description of what was changed (2-3 sentences)&#10;&#10;## Why&#10;Why this change was needed (context, problem being solved)&#10;&#10;## How&#10;Key technical decisions and approach&#10;&#10;## Testing&#10;What testing was done or is needed&#10;&#10;## Breaking Changes&#10;List any breaking changes, or &quot;None&quot;&#10;&#10;Keep it concise but complete. Avoid generic phrases like &quot;this PR implements...&quot;`;&#10;&#10;  const response = await anthropic.messages.create({&#10;    model: &#39;claude-sonnet-4-5&#39;,&#10;    max_tokens: 1500,&#10;    messages: [{ role: &#39;user&#39;, content: prompt }],&#10;  });&#10;&#10;  return response.content[0].text;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// scripts/pr-description-gen.mjs</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> generatePRDescription</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">diff</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">commits</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">linkedIssues</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> prompt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `Generate a clear, structured PR description based on the following:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Code diff (first 3000 chars):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">diff</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">slice</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3000</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Commit messages:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">commits</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">map</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">((</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=></span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `- ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">message</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">).</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\n</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">linkedIssues</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">length</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ?</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `Linked issues: ${</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">linkedIssues</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">join</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">', '</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">)</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}`</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> :</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> ''}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Output a markdown PR description with these sections:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## What</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Brief description of what was changed (2-3 sentences)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## Why</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Why this change was needed (context, problem being solved)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## How</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Key technical decisions and approach</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## Testing</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">What testing was done or is needed</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">## Breaking Changes</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">List any breaking changes, or \"None\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Keep it concise but complete. Avoid generic phrases like \"this PR implements...\"`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> response</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> anthropic.messages.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">create</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    model: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'claude-sonnet-4-5'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    max_tokens: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1500</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    messages: [{ role: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'user'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, content: prompt }],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> response.content[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">].text;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>GitHub Actions 中自动更新空白或不完整的 PR 描述：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"- name: Auto-complete PR Description&#10;  if: github.event.action == &#39;opened&#39;&#10;  uses: actions/github-script@v7&#10;  with:&#10;    script: |&#10;      const body = context.payload.pull_request.body || &#39;&#39;;&#10;      // 描述少于 100 字符时触发自动生成&#10;      if (body.trim().length &lt; 100) {&#10;        const generated = await generateDescription();&#10;        await github.rest.pulls.update({&#10;          ...context.repo,&#10;          pull_number: context.payload.pull_request.number,&#10;          body: generated&#10;        });&#10;      }\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">- </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Auto-complete PR Description</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">github.event.action == 'opened'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  uses</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">actions/github-script@v7</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  with</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    script</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      const body = context.payload.pull_request.body || '';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      // 描述少于 100 字符时触发自动生成</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      if (body.trim().length &#x3C; 100) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        const generated = await generateDescription();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        await github.rest.pulls.update({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          ...context.repo,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          pull_number: context.payload.pull_request.number,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">          body: generated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">        });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">      }</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"智能审查者分配\">智能审查者分配</h2><p>基于文件变更历史和代码所有权的审查者推荐：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"javascript\" data-code=\"// 计算每个候选审查者的适合度分数&#10;async function rankReviewers(changedFiles, prAuthor) {&#10;  const candidates = await getCandidateReviewers(changedFiles, prAuthor);&#10;&#10;  const scores = await Promise.all(&#10;    candidates.map(async (reviewer) =&gt; {&#10;      const score = await computeReviewerScore(reviewer, changedFiles);&#10;      return { reviewer, score };&#10;    }),&#10;  );&#10;&#10;  return scores.sort((a, b) =&gt; b.score - a.score).slice(0, 2); // 推荐前 2 名&#10;}&#10;&#10;async function computeReviewerScore(reviewer, changedFiles) {&#10;  // 维度 1：文件所有权（CODEOWNERS 匹配）&#10;  const ownershipScore = computeOwnershipScore(reviewer, changedFiles);&#10;&#10;  // 维度 2：近期修改历史（过去 30 天内修改过这些文件的频次）&#10;  const recentActivityScore = await getRecentActivityScore(reviewer, changedFiles);&#10;&#10;  // 维度 3：当前 review 负载（正在审查的 PR 数量，越少越好）&#10;  const loadScore = await getReviewerLoadScore(reviewer);&#10;&#10;  // 维度 4：时区可用性（与 PR 作者时区重叠度）&#10;  const timezoneScore = computeTimezoneScore(reviewer);&#10;&#10;  return ownershipScore * 0.4 + recentActivityScore * 0.3 + loadScore * 0.2 + timezoneScore * 0.1;&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 计算每个候选审查者的适合度分数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">async</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> function</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> rankReviewers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">changedFiles</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">prAuthor</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> candidates</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> getCandidateReviewers</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(changedFiles, prAuthor);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> scores</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> await</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> Promise</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">all</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    candi